{
  "title": "Kicked Up Greek Red Potatoes Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting Mediterranean stew featuring red potatoes and a blend of bitter and gooey flavors, perfect for a sick day. This kosher-friendly dish is made with fermented ingredients and a variety of spices.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
  "diet": [
